      "hizbQuarter": 53,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 836,
      "text": "Say, “What do you think, if the punishment of Allah were to come upon you, suddenly or predictably, who would be destroyed except the wrongdoing people?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 6,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنۡعَامِ",
        "englishName": "Al-An'aam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cattle",
        "numberOfAyahs": 165,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 47,
      "juz": 7,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 133,
      "ruku": 106,
      "hizbQuarter": 53,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 837,
      "text": "We do not send the messengers except as bringers of glad tidings and as warners. Those who believe and mend their ways, they will have no fear, nor will they grieve.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 6,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنۡعَامِ",
        "englishName": "Al-An'aam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cattle",
        "numberOfAyahs": 165,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 48,
      "juz": 7,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 133,
      "ruku": 106,
      "hizbQuarter": 53,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 838,
      "text": "But those who reject Our verses will be afflicted with the punishment for their evil deeds.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 6,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنۡعَامِ",
        "englishName": "Al-An'aam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cattle",
        "numberOfAyahs": 165,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 49,
      "juz": 7,
